{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026H53hby2nN61792704385.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣周四晚發生7級地震，當局啟動四級應急響應，央視報道至少18死、逾30人傷。</p><p></p><p>地震一刻，民眾爭相走到街上避險。有監控鏡頭拍到食肆搖晃，工作人員匆忙離開。超市部分物品從貨架跌下。《西藏日報》報道，較接近震央的崗切鄉震感強烈，當地有災民受傷送院，部分房屋牆身龜裂。距離巴青縣30公里的索縣，有明顯震感。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T44C82jjuP1792704381.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>事發在昨晚10時33分，震源深度10公里。新華社指震央附近屬高原，平均海拔約4,800米，周邊人口稀少。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pbmng1Hrto1792704379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>巴青縣及甘肅消防救援隊伍等單位趕去災區善後。國務院抗震救災指揮部啟動四級應急響應，指示相關部門全力做好搶險救援，安置居民及震情監測等工作。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE-0500_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026tj3zNm0VWN1792704376.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:13:25.575292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T21:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:10:49.350564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:10:49.350564+00:00","content_hash":"144803dced4aeaf7346ff172db666eac9f558afa1b2bb3fdc3151efb1e02d530","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}